  "idea": "Espanso: free cross-platform text expander that saves thousands of keystrokes",
  "text": "This free tool replaces short keywords with full paragraphs across any application. Answering repetitive prospect inquiries requires constantly digging through saved drafts and documentation links. Switching between browser tabs to copy stock answers destroys conversational flow during live client chats. Espanso matches your typed trigger words in real time, expanding two letters into full multi-line proposals. You communicate ten times faster without opening draft documents.",
